# Copy this file to the per-user DEcode config directory as `privacy.ignore`
# to add machine-wide, additive sensitive-path rules.
#
# Add repository-specific rules to `.decodeignore` in that repository.
# Both files use gitignore syntax. Negation can refine rules in the same file,
# but it can never weaken DEcode's built-in secret patterns.

**/customer-data/**
**/*.production-secret
local/private-notes.md
